# pkg-config alias: newer distros (Debian 13, Ubuntu 24.04+) ship only
# WebKitGTK 4.1 (libsoup 3), which is API-compatible for pad2go's window.
# Build with: PKG_CONFIG_PATH=$PWD/packaging/linux go build ./cmd/pad2go
Name: webkit2gtk-4.0 (alias of webkit2gtk-4.1)
Description: WebKitGTK 4.1 under the 4.0 name expected by webview_go
Version: 2.40.0
Requires: webkit2gtk-4.1
